{'symbol': 'JNPR', 'date': '2023-05-23 03:00:00', 'title': "KORIAN BENELUX FUTURE-PROOFS ITS RESIDENTIAL CARE CENTERS WITH JUNIPER NETWORKS' AI-DRIVEN ENTERPRISE SOLUTIONS", 'text': "SUNNYVALE, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--JUNIPER NETWORKS® (NYSE: JNPR), A LEADER IN SECURE, AI-DRIVEN NETWORKS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT KORIAN BENELUX, PART OF A MAJOR EUROPEAN HEALTHCARE AND LONG-TERM ELDERLY CARE ORGANIZATION, SELECTED JUNIPER'S AI-DRIVEN ENTERPRISE SOLUTIONS, INCLUDING WIRELESS AND WIRED ACCESS, TO OPTIMIZE NETWORK PERFORMANCE AND RELIABILITY AND DELIVER PERSONALIZED CARE FOR ITS RESIDENTS. MORE THAN 11 THOUSAND KORIAN EMPLOYEES PROVIDE CARE FOR APPROXIMATELY 15 THOUSAND RESIDENTS."}